    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16875" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄσφαλτος</span></b> , ἡ (also
			ὁ, <i><span class="en">
			Gal.
			13.784
		</span></i>), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>asphalt, bitumen,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.179
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				6.119
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				16.100
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.73
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. ὀρυκτή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Mir.</u>
					842b15
				</span></i>
			:— also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄσφαλτον</span></b> , τό, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
			</span></i><i>Aër.</i><i><span class="en">
				7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ti.Locr.
				99c
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> a kind of
				<i>petroleum,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.99
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>pitch,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ge.</u>
				6.14
			</span></i>. (<i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.420
			</span></i> derives it from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σφάλλω.</span>)</div>
